0:{"buildId":"HaSH0nfWkwbFYqcaqq3RQ","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"x:mx-auto x:flex x:max-w-(--nextra-content-width)","children":["$","$L2",null,{"value":[{"value":"Property","id":"property","depth":2},{"value":"Type","id":"type","depth":2},{"value":"Usage","id":"usage","depth":2},{"value":"Notes","id":"notes","depth":2},{"value":"Related Properties","id":"related-properties","depth":2}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","$L4",null,{"metadata":{"title":"error","filePath":"content/hooks/useWalletConnect/error.mdx","timestamp":1770719093000},"sourceCode":"# error\n\nError object if an error occurred during connection or other wallet operations.\n\n## Property\n\n`error: Error | null`\n\n## Type\n\n`Error | null` - Error object if an error occurred, `null` otherwise\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\n  import { useWalletConnect } from \"__PACKAGE_NAME__\";\n\n  function ConnectionStatus() {\n    const { error, openModal, isConnected } = useWalletConnect();\n\n    if (error) {\n      return (\n        <div>\n          <p>Error: {error.message}</p>\n          <button onClick={openModal}>Try Again</button>\n        </div>\n      );\n    }\n\n    return (\n      <div>\n        Status: {isConnected ? \"Connected\" : \"Not Connected\"}\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Returns `null` if no error has occurred\n- Error is cleared when a new connection attempt is made\n- Common errors include:\n  - User rejection\n  - Network errors\n  - Wallet not available\n  - Chain not supported\n\n## Related Properties\n\n- `isConnected` - Connection status\n- `isConnecting` - Connection in progress status","children":[["$","div",null,{"id":"nextra-skip-nav"}],["$","main",null,{"data-pagefind-body":true,"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-bold x:mt-2 x:text-4xl","children":["error","$undefined"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"Erro